 "construct": "cassini",
 "name": "Cassini",
 "about": "Cassini from Cape Canaveral to Saturn: four flybys, the deep space manoeuvre and the Saturn orbit insertion, then thirteen years of a tour reshaped by Titan flybys, kept here as one osculating orbit per year (the big-burns fudge), and the plunge into Saturn on 15 Sep 2017. Huygens splits off on 25 Dec 2004. Flyby times and distances, the burns and the orbits are read from JPL Horizons (scripts/spaceflight/horizons_cassini.json).",
